# Publish / push (mandatory)

Canonical docs: [`docs/publish-runbook.md`](docs/publish-runbook.md), [`docs/agent-github-factory-publish.md`](docs/agent-github-factory-publish.md). Badges: [`.cursor/rules/green-badges.mdc`](green-badges.mdc). Org: [`.cursor/rules/github-org-alexar76.mdc`](github-org-alexar76.mdc).

## Order

1. **Commit** (stage only intended files — never `git add -A`; leave warden scan memory alone).
2. **Gitea** (full monorepo): `./scripts/push_gitea_monorepo.sh`
3. **GitHub**: `./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh` (or `--factory-only` / `--satellite <id>`) — **scripts only**.

## Identity: alexar76 — do not freestyle

- All public GitHub pushes go to **`alexar76`** via the publish scripts + `GH_PAT` / `GITHUB_TOKEN`.
- **Do not invent remotes.** Do not invent `AICOM_FACTORY_REMOTE` variants (`git@…`, `gh` remote name, other orgs, Gitea URLs).
- **Do not** “work around” a failed publish by guessing remotes. Scripts already know the org. If env is missing, use **exactly** the documented factory URL below — nothing else.
- Local `gh` may be another account — that is **not** the publish identity. Use `GH_PAT` for alexar76.

## Never

- Plain `git push` / `git push origin` / `git push gh` to GitHub for this monorepo.
- Pointing factory publish at Gitea `origin` (would wipe canon).
- Pushing the **full** monorepo (with satellites) to `alexar76/aicom`.
- Ad-hoc remote URLs, SSH host aliases as publish targets, or “helpful” remote overrides.
- Publishing **independent/** or **attested** deploy/runbooks to GitHub (factory or satellites)
  until explicitly flipped. That includes `independent/`, `attested-*`, SaaS shells,
  `saas-compose.yml`, `SAAS_PROJECTS.md`, and `scripts/deploy_attested_memory.sh`.
  Gitea only. Attested satellites stay `github_published: false` until you say otherwise.

## GitHub factory (only when env unset)

Guard refuses Gitea `origin`. If `AICOM_FACTORY_REMOTE` is **already set** in the shell — use it, do not override. If unset, only this value:

```bash
GH_PAT=<token> \
AICOM_FACTORY_REMOTE=https://github.com/alexar76/aicom.git \
./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh --factory-only
```

## GitHub satellite

```bash
GH_PAT=<token> ./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh --satellite <id>
# or: ./scripts/mirror_satellites.sh --satellite <id>
```

## Mental model

| Path | Script | Target |
|------|--------|--------|
| Full monorepo | `push_gitea_monorepo.sh` | Gitea only |
| Trimmed `aicom` | `publish_all_repos.sh --factory-only` | `github.com/alexar76/aicom` |
| One satellite | `publish_all_repos.sh --satellite` | that GitHub repo under alexar76 |
